00:16:10,128 --> 00:16:11,128
 1, 2, 3!

287
00:16:12,128 --> 00:16:13,128
 That's not it!

288
00:16:13,128 --> 00:16:15,128
 It's not in the song.

289
00:16:15,128 --> 00:16:19,128
 Today, I'm wearing a uniform!

290
00:16:20,384 --> 00:16:22,384
 Hitoka did it for me.

291
00:16:22,384 --> 00:16:23,384
 Yes, I did.

292
00:16:23,384 --> 00:16:24,384
 Wait a moment.

293
00:16:24,384 --> 00:16:25,384
 Wait a moment.

294
00:16:27,384 --> 00:16:28,384
 Isn't it great?

295
00:16:28,384 --> 00:16:30,384
 Hitoka, you did your best, didn't you?

296
00:16:30,384 --> 00:16:31,384
 Yes, I did.

297
00:16:33,384 --> 00:16:34,384
 It's great.

298
00:16:39,384 --> 00:16:43,384
 So, we are Hitoka and Haru.

299
00:16:43,384 --> 00:16:44,384
 See you!

300
00:16:44,384 --> 00:16:45,384
 Bye bye!

301
00:16:45,384 --> 00:16:48,384
 Let's do it together next time!

302
00:16:52,072 --> 00:16:53,072
 I did it!

303
00:16:54,072 --> 00:16:56,072
 Isn't it different from usual?

304
00:16:57,072 --> 00:16:58,072
 I got it!

305
00:16:58,072 --> 00:17:00,072
 I did it! I got the license!

306
00:17:04,256 --> 00:17:06,256
 Let's go play together.

307
00:17:08,256 --> 00:17:10,256
 Bye bye.

308
00:17:13,256 --> 00:17:17,256
 We got a new hairband.

309
00:17:17,256 --> 00:17:18,256
 Yay!

310
00:17:18,256 --> 00:17:20,256
 Thank you.

311
00:17:22,256 --> 00:17:25,256
 Haru, you said you got a new hairband,
so I thought your bangs got a new
hairband.

312
00:17:27,256 --> 00:17:29,256
 I got a new hairband today.

313
00:17:29,256 --> 00:17:37,256
 I met Julia on the day of the video
shoot.

314
00:17:37,256 --> 00:17:45,256
 So, when I asked her to show me her
teeth, she didn't show me at all.

315
00:17:45,256 --> 00:17:48,256
 It was before I was discharged from the
hospital, so I was still a NG.

316
00:17:48,256 --> 00:17:59,256
 The members were also NG.

317
00:17:59,256 --> 00:18:02,256
 We started the show today.

318
00:18:02,256 --> 00:18:06,256
 Who is here today?

319
00:18:06,256 --> 00:18:08,256
 Let's go.

320
00:18:09,256 --> 00:18:12,256
 It's Kanami from Suzy.

321
00:18:12,256 --> 00:18:15,256
 Yay!

322
00:18:15,256 --> 00:18:17,256
 I'm wearing a yukata.

323
00:18:17,256 --> 00:18:18,256
 Look.

324
00:18:18,256 --> 00:18:22,256
 It's summer.

325
00:18:23,256 --> 00:18:25,256
 It's a flash firework.

326
00:18:25,256 --> 00:18:29,256
 I want to be with you all in the flash
firework.

327
00:18:30,256 --> 00:18:32,256
 Bambi is here.

328
00:18:32,256 --> 00:18:34,256
 I'm here.

329
00:18:34,256 --> 00:18:41,256
 Bambi's birthday party was over, and so
was Kanami.

330
00:18:41,256 --> 00:18:43,256
 It's over.

331
00:18:44,256 --> 00:18:46,256
 It was fun.

332
00:18:46,256 --> 00:18:48,256
 So, hurry up and tell us about Bambi.

333
00:18:48,256 --> 00:18:51,256
 Tell us about Bambi.

334
00:18:51,256 --> 00:18:52,256
 No.

335
00:18:52,256 --> 00:18:53,256
 What should I do?

336
00:18:53,256 --> 00:18:54,256
 Please.

337
00:18:54,256 --> 00:18:55,256
 I'm sorry.

338
00:18:55,256 --> 00:18:58,256
 I'm sorry to ask you such a cute
request.

339
00:18:58,256 --> 00:18:59,256
 I want to hear it.

340
00:18:59,256 --> 00:19:03,256
 I've been asking you to do it in the
dressing room, but you said no.

341
00:19:03,256 --> 00:19:04,256
 Look.

342
00:19:04,256 --> 00:19:07,256
 It's not fair.

343
00:19:09,256 --> 00:19:10,256
 I'll ask you later.

344
00:19:10,256 --> 00:19:12,256
 No.

345
00:19:16,256 --> 00:19:18,256
 I ate a bear cake.

346
00:19:18,256 --> 00:19:19,256
 It looked delicious.

347
00:19:19,256 --> 00:19:21,256
 It was delicious.

348
00:19:21,256 --> 00:19:22,256
 It was good.

349
00:19:22,256 --> 00:19:24,256
 I wanted you to surprise me.

350
00:19:24,256 --> 00:19:29,256
 I wanted you to surprise me, so I asked
you to do it.

351
00:19:29,256 --> 00:19:32,256
 Look at the point of this yukata.

352
00:19:32,256 --> 00:19:34,256
 It's red.

353
00:19:35,256 --> 00:19:39,256
 Bambi likes yukatas like Japanese
clothes.

354
00:19:39,256 --> 00:19:40,256
 I like it.

355
00:19:40,256 --> 00:19:42,256
 I like festivals.

356
00:19:42,256 --> 00:19:43,256
 It's the season.

357
00:19:43,256 --> 00:19:44,256
 It's great.

358
00:19:44,256 --> 00:19:45,256
 It's summer.

359
00:19:45,256 --> 00:19:48,256
 I like the atmosphere of festivals and
summer.

360
00:19:48,256 --> 00:19:51,256
 I talked too much.

361
00:19:51,256 --> 00:20:10,650
 Bye bye.

362
00:20:10,650 --> 00:20:14,310
 I'm being perfunctory as always.

363
00:20:14,410 --> 00:20:15,890
 Next week

364
00:20:19,810 --> 00:20:20,930
 I-I'm still wrong?!

365
00:20:25,350 --> 00:20:27,690
 Unless Yuuka is wrong, can't be at
peace?!

366
00:20:27,690 --> 00:20:32,690
 To the future!

367
00:20:34,416 --> 00:20:46,016
 Their previous album is the best sales
of seasonal items!

368
00:20:46,016 --> 00:20:49,516
 Until the day we meet again-

369
00:21:01,616 --> 00:21:03,616
 It's so close.
